            "id": "event:helsinki-2026:long_description",
            "object_type": "event",
            "object_id": "helsinki-2026",
            "field": "long_description",
            "source_language": "en",
            "source_text": "Takafumi 'Taka' Nakayama Sensei, 7th Dan from Shido-kan Fukuoka, Japan, will visit Finland on 29–30 August as part of his European Tour 2026.\r\nTaka’s karate is based on a natural and practical approach to generating power.\r\nThe seminar is open to practitioners of all karate and budo styles, as well as participants of all experience levels.\r\nYou can get an impression of his teaching by visiting the Fukuoka Shido-kan YouTube channel: @fukuoka-shidokan-karate",
            "source_hash": "edc74805b474ef15539767644382d7c29765fec8bc62e4c5c5b53e4befc76525",
